  "resume": "This video documents the 2007 Swiss court ruling against Dogu Perincek for denying the Armenian Genocide, marking the world's first such conviction under anti-racism law. It shows Perincek leaving the Lausanne court surrounded by supporters and journalists, with statements from Perincek, Eric Cottier, and Sarkis Shahinian. The footage was produced by Swiss public broadcaster SF."
